# What a `vercel deploy` of the source tree must never upload: the raw palm
# captures and the eval fixtures (biometric, and large), the reference images
# (the user's own stills), any video, and the build cache. The source-tree
# upload of M1.1's tree (980 kB) failed on "fetch failed" three times running
# with these included; the deploy is now `vercel build --prod` followed by
# `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`, and this file keeps the fallback honest.
captures/
fixtures/
docs/reference/
*.mp4
*.webm
.next/cache
